            "escalated": false,
            "lane": "review",
            "reply": "Hi Priya,\n\nSorry to hear about the missed classes. Here's what I can share.\n\n1) SMS reminders: the most common causes are (a) no message credits left (check Settings → Billing → Message credits; reminders pause when credits run out), (b) clients who replied STOP, (c) phone numbers missing a country code, or (d) appointments booked inside the reminder window. Reports → Reminder log shows each reminder's status (sent, failed, skipped) and the reason, which should show what happened since Monday. If none of these explain it, let us know what the log shows and a teammate will follow up.\n\n2) Invoices: all invoices are in Settings → Billing → Invoices, where you can download PDFs. Adding your company name and VAT number under Billing details only applies to future invoices. For corrected copies of the August and September invoices, please contact the billing team and include the details you need added.\n\nSlotwise Support",
